39
00:02:55.470 --> 00:02:57.170
Mäletan isa poolt

40
00:02:57.270 --> 00:03:00.110
Eestis man.

41
00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:01.940
Real.

42
00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:06.230
Ma laseks endale kuuli pähe,
kui ma oleksin aksel.

43
00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:08.390
Aga ma vaatan,
