45
00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:12.410
Tundub, et mehed ka.

46
00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:15.950
Laura, tule mulle naiseks. Kas.

47
00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.600
Me oleme su eksamitöö.

48
00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:24.010
Poiss filmis meid salaja üles pani
selle Youtube'i interneti,

49
00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:27.539
