171
00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:26.650
Ules mul mees.

172
00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:29.530
Sa ei pea ennast prostituudina
tundma.

173
00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:36.140
See on doonoritasu spermapalk.
No ma ei tea, mis see tavaliselt on

174
