175
00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:44.290
Viis kümpi pauk.

176
00:10:45.730 --> 00:10:48.930
No ma võin sõbramehe poolest rohkem
ka maksta.

177
00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:56.579
Mõtlesin, et.

178
00:10:56.679 --> 00:10:59.490
Teeme siis.

179
00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:01.890
Teeme soita.

180
00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:05.450
Nii.

181
00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:07.670
Kui see

182
