190
00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.470
Sa peaks mu rongi peal olema ja.

191
00:11:37.429 --> 00:11:44.580
Mis juhtus, ajakene üla on haiglas.
Issand jumal, mis juhtus

192
00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:47.900
